4:45. The alarm. Off before the second ring. House stays asleep.

3
00:00:04,800 --> 00:00:07,400
4:52. The coffee. Set up last night. Best decision of the day.

4
00:00:07,400 --> 00:00:10,000
4:58. The bag check. Skates. Helmet. The other glove.

5
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:12,600
5:05. The wake-up. Round one. Round two. Round three.

6
